    <string name="mapkit_key_help"><![CDATA[The MapKit SDK key lets the application show the Yandex map (the \"Yandex\" choice in the Map menu). Without the key the grid is shown instead of the map. A new key works after the application is restarted.<br><br>A free key is issued in the Yandex developer dashboard, service \"MapKit – mobile SDK\":<br><a href="https://developer.tech.yandex.ru/services">https://developer.tech.yandex.ru/services</a>]]></string>
    <string name="geocoder_key_help"><![CDATA[The HTTP Geocoder key is used by \"Add → Request map data\" in the point editor: the name, postal code and address of the place at the point coordinates are added to the point.<br><br>The key is issued in the Yandex developer dashboard, service \"JavaScript API and HTTP Geocoder\":<br><a href="https://developer.tech.yandex.ru/services">https://developer.tech.yandex.ru/services</a>]]></string>
